  - age effects
  - web experiment
abstract: >-
  Code and de-identified data for a large-scale web experiment (N = 1,664)
  examining human ability to discriminate real face photographs from
  AI-generated portraits produced by ChatGPT-4o and Imagen 3 (via Gemini 2.5),
  with stimuli created in July 2025 and data collected August 2025 – January 2026.
